"x" Enter "y" Enter     # [1]/-1 [2]/-1
Enter                   # /1
Up Up*7 Esc "s"         # at /2, review to [1] Done and skip it
Enter                   # /1
Up Up*8 Esc "e"         # at /2, review to [1]/-1 Done and edit
Backspace "z" Enter     # [1]/-1 seeded x
Esc "s"                 # [1], asked as its former Skip differs from Done
Enter*3                 # /1 /2 survey:
